sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist
    participant Dashboard as RHOAI Dashboard
    participant Controller as RHOAI Notebook<br/>Controller
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant OAuth as OAuth Proxy Sidecar<br/>8443/TCP TLS
    participant Jupyter as JupyterLab Server<br/>8888/TCP HTTP
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant KFP as Kubeflow Pipelines<br/>API Server
    participant S3 as S3-Compatible<br/>Storage
    participant MLflow as MLflow<br/>Tracking Server
    participant Ray as Ray/CodeFlare<br/>Cluster

    Note over User, Dashboard: Notebook Lifecycle Management
    User->>Dashboard: Request new notebook workspace
    Dashboard->>Controller: Create Notebook CR
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create Pod, Service, Route
    Controller->>OAuth: Inject OAuth Proxy sidecar
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Resources created

    Note over User, Jupyter: User Access Flow
    User->>Route: HTTPS request to notebook URL
    Route->>OAuth: Forward (TLS terminated)
    OAuth->>OAuth: Validate OpenShift OAuth token
    OAuth->>Jupyter: Forward authenticated request<br/>HTTP/8888
    Jupyter-->>OAuth: JupyterLab UI/API response
    OAuth-->>Route: Response
    Route-->>User: HTTPS response

    Note over Jupyter, Ray: Platform SDK Interactions (from notebook code)
    Jupyter->>KFP: Submit pipeline run<br/>(kfp SDK, ServiceAccount token)
    KFP-->>Jupyter: Pipeline run status

    Jupyter->>S3: Read/write data artifacts<br/>(boto3, user credentials)
    S3-->>Jupyter: Data objects

    Jupyter->>MLflow: Log experiment metrics<br/>(mlflow SDK)
    MLflow-->>Jupyter: Experiment tracking data

    Jupyter->>Ray: Submit distributed job<br/>(codeflare-sdk, Ray client)
    Ray-->>Jupyter: Job results

    Jupyter->>K8sAPI: Manage K8s resources<br/>(kubernetes SDK, ServiceAccount token)
    K8sAPI-->>Jupyter: Resource status
